WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Supply chain diversification reduces single-country dependency.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Nearshoring can shorten lead times but raises labor costs.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Currency volatility affects export competitiveness.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Policy incentives shape where factories are built.
